{"id":7977,"date":"2021-10-05T20:36:45","date_gmt":"2021-10-06T00:36:45","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?p=7977"},"modified":"2021-10-05T20:36:45","modified_gmt":"2021-10-06T00:36:45","slug":"campground-review-cabelas-sidney-nebraska","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2021\/10\/05\/campground-review-cabelas-sidney-nebraska\/","title":{"rendered":"Campground Review &#8211; Cabela&#8217;s Sidney Nebraska"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>After spending two wonderful cool fall days and nights at Historic Fort Robinson State Park we made our way down U.S. 385 to our next stop at Sidney Nebraska.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-1 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-1 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\"><ul class=\"blocks-gallery-grid\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211003_155046441.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211003_155046441.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8015\" class=\"wp-image-8015\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211003_155046441.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211003_155046441-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211003_155046441-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">Free RV &amp; Truck Parking<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><\/ul><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>This location is the World Headquarters for Cabela&#8217;s and has two very large multi-story office buildings behind the store, loads of customer parking out front and lots of free truck and RV parking along with free dump station and fresh water fill for the RV&#8217;ers.  Thank you Cabela&#8217;s!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>This Cabela&#8217;s also has a full hook-up campground (for a fee of course) but if you can get by with out needing hook-ups and you can sleep to the constant hum of diesel truck engines and their refrigerator trailers running all night &#8230; well then &#8211; free is good!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>We arrived mid-afternoon, the four of us grocery shopped across the street at Walmart, ate dinner at a nice little Mexican joint just down the street, and then settled in for the night.  We really were not bothered by the trucks and we have ample fresh water\/waste water capacity along with plenty of solar and batteries to run the TV in the evening and the furnace in the morning to take off the chill.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>We did just fine, but it is fall and the temp got down to 49 degrees last night so all our windows were closed and the hum of the motors was dampened somewhat.  If it was summer, the noise might be too loud.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>As always, you can click on any of the thumbnails below to see a larger image<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-3 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-2 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\"><ul class=\"blocks-gallery-grid\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211003_174116444.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211003_174116444.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8062\" class=\"wp-image-8062\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211003_174116444.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211003_174116444-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211003_174116444-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">My Burrito Platter<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211003_172353223.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211003_172353223.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8063\" class=\"wp-image-8063\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211003_172353223.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211003_172353223-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211003_172353223-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">Chips &amp; Avocado<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211003_174039673.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211003_174039673.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8064\" class=\"wp-image-8064\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211003_174039673.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211003_174039673-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211003_174039673-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">The girls both had Shrimp Tacos<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211003_174111049.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211003_174111049.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8065\" class=\"wp-image-8065\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211003_174111049.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211003_174111049-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211003_174111049-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">David&#8217;s Nacho Supreme<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><\/ul><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p> In the morning we went on into Cabela&#8217;s and did a little shopping (mostly looking).  They have SO MUCH STUFF!  It&#8217;s fun to look at all their offerings from knives, to tents, clothing, shoes\/boots, camping supplies, guns, and more.  It&#8217;s always great to look at their wild game displays too.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-3 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-3 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\"><ul class=\"blocks-gallery-grid\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211004_103715159-1.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211004_103715159-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8072\" class=\"wp-image-8072\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211004_103715159-1.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211004_103715159-1-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211004_103715159-1-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211004_103132648-1.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211004_103132648-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8073\" class=\"wp-image-8073\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211004_103132648-1.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211004_103132648-1-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211004_103132648-1-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211004_103112381-1.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211004_103112381-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8074\" class=\"wp-image-8074\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211004_103112381-1.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211004_103112381-1-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211004_103112381-1-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><\/ul><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>After Cabela&#8217;s we decided it was time for a late breakfast and Kathy found this great little place that serves breakfast until 10am, then closes until they open for dinner at 5pm.  It&#8217;s family owned and operated by the same family since the beginning.  We enjoyed great atmosphere, super service and outstandingly tasty food!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-3 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-4 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\"><ul class=\"blocks-gallery-grid\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211004_095632338.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211004_095632338.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8075\" class=\"wp-image-8075\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211004_095632338.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211004_095632338-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211004_095632338-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211004_095615972.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211004_095615972.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8076\" class=\"wp-image-8076\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211004_095615972.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211004_095615972-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211004_095615972-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211004_095428706.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211004_095428706.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8077\" class=\"wp-image-8077\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211004_095428706.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211004_095428706-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211004_095428706-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211004_095306820.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content